   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.2</span>\n<h2>Grading: every mark and its weight</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Read this in week one — part of the grade is earned in class long before any exam.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13598 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.2</span>\n<h2>Cách tính điểm: đủ mọi đầu điểm và trọng số</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đọc ngay tuần đầu — một phần điểm được tính trong lớp từ rất sớm, trước mọi kỳ thi.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13598 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Category<br><small>Đầu điểm</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Parts<br><small>Số phần</small></th><th>Weight<br><small>Trọng số</small></th><th>Completion criteria<br><small>Điều kiện hoàn thành</small></th><th>Duration<br><small>Thời lượng</small></th><th>CLO</th><th>Question type<br><small>Dạng câu hỏi</small></th><th>No. of questions<br><small>Số câu</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Essay test</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>15.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>&quot;OP1: 45 mins - 60 minsOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal&quot;</td><td>LO11, LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO12, LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO13, LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO16, LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6, LO7, LO19, LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4</td><td>OP1: Comprehensive exercises cover mainly chapter 11, 12, 13, 16,19OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Group Assignment</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>15.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>&quot;OP1: 4 weeksOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal&quot;</td><td></td><td>OP1: Case study - Report and Presentation in class (end of the course)OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Individual Assignment</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>10.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>&quot;OP1: 4 weeksOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal&quot;</td><td></td><td>OP1: 1,500 word - reportOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Progress Test 1,2,3</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>3</td><td><strong>30.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>OP1: 30 mins - 45 minsOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</td><td>LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5</td><td>OP1: Multiple choice questions and/or exercisesOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Final exam</strong></td><td>Final exam</td><td>1</td><td><strong>30.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>60 minutes</td><td>Multiple choice questions (45-50). Multiple choice questions cover all chapters</td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The weights add up to <strong>100%</strong>. Minimum average to pass: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>How to read \"Completion criteria\":</em> it is the minimum score that one mark must reach (e.g. <code>&gt;0</code> = you must not get zero / must sit it; <code>4</code> = at least 4/10). Missing it can mean failing the subject even with a good average — this reading is the website's explanation, the table itself is the university's.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tổng trọng số đúng <strong>100%</strong>. Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua môn: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>Cách đọc cột \"Điều kiện hoàn thành\":</em> là điểm tối thiểu đầu điểm đó phải đạt (vd <code>&gt;0</code> = không được 0 / phải dự; <code>4</code> = tối thiểu 4/10). Không đạt có thể trượt môn dù điểm trung bình cao — phần giải thích này là của web, bảng là của trường.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>The fine print per mark (verbatim)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Essay test</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills of chapters covered so far<br><em>Grading guide:</em> As solution</li>\n<li><strong>Group Assignment</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Thinking creatively, making decisions, solving problems,Personal qualities: Individual responsibility, self-esteem, sociability, self-management, and integrity.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> - By instructor<br><br>- Group's mark considered as related individual's mark</li>\n<li><strong>Individual Assignment</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills<br><em>Grading guide:</em> By instructor</li>\n<li><strong>Progress Test 1,2,3</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills of chapters covered so far<br><em>Grading guide:</em> As solution<br><em>Note:</em> These quizzes will be given at various times during class (beginning, middle or end).</li>\n<li><strong>Final exam</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills of chapters covered in the subject<br><em>Grading guide:</em> By Exam board</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Chi tiết từng đầu điểm (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Essay test</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills of chapters covered so far<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> As solution</li>\n<li><strong>Group Assignment</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Thinking creatively, making decisions, solving problems,Personal qualities: Individual responsibility, self-esteem, sociability, self-management, and integrity.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> - By instructor<br><br>- Group's mark considered as related individual's mark</li>\n<li><strong>Individual Assignment</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> By instructor</li>\n<li><strong>Progress Test 1,2,3</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills of chapters covered so far<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> As solution<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> These quizzes will be given at various times during class (beginning, middle or end).</li>\n<li><strong>Final exam</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Integration of studied knowledge and skills of chapters covered in the subject<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> By Exam board</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
