   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 11 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13598 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>11 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13598 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Understand basic terminology and supply chain operations in the context of today’s business environment</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Align the supply management and enterprise objectives</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Apply methods relating to time, quality and costs in order to improve the efficiency of purchasing process and increase the<br>competitiveness of the supply chain</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Recognise the supplier selection process and apply the Six Sigma in supplier quality management</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Recognize the important relationship between inventory management and delivering the perfect customer order</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Apply lean and just in time thinking within a supply chain</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Explain the importance of collaboration and integration within supply chains, and be able to account for different<br>tools for this</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Explain the purchasing function’s field of responsibility</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Explain different models and strategies for purchasing</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Describe purchasing work from a total cost perspective</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td><strong>CLO11</strong></td><td>Analyse a purchasing process and suggest improvements</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13598</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
